							<p align="center"><font face="Verdana" color="#ff0000" size="6"><strong><em><u>DARK TRANQUILITY NEWS</u></em></strong></font></p> <p align="center"><img src="/pics/2112/world2.gif" /></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">We had a guild meeting on Wed. Dec 22nd and, as with most guild meetings, it was a mixture of democracy in action and soap opera.... lol.&nbsp; We actually accomplished alot and it was clear that our guild has a fairly unified vision of where we're going.&nbsp; Every guild hits bumpy roads and that is ok, it is a sign of growth.&nbsp; A guild that does not experience growing pains has stopped growing, and is on its way out.&nbsp; Embrace the challenges, Life Takers.</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4">We welcome 2 new officers to the War Council after the Dec. 22nd meeting.&nbsp; Congratulations to Lupnoir and Kornin.&nbsp; You will be a welcome addition to our officers.</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">We have been working hard to get everyone flagged for PoJ and have been very successful.&nbsp; Gratz to all who have received their flags!&nbsp;&nbsp;More flags coming.</font></p> <p align="left"><font color="#ffffff"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4">Congratulations to our new Communications Officer.... Kawika..... We really appreciate you!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">Congratulations to all who participated in our very successful Chardok raid on Sunday, Dec. 12th.&nbsp; We were able to get 4 epic pieces and kill both the King and the Queen twice each with absolutely no loss of life to our raiding party.........Woot!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">Special thanks to Tine and Aideen for a ton of behind the scenes work on the Chardok raid.&nbsp; Their hard work made mine so much easier.&nbsp; You guys kicked arse!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4">Big thanks to friends from other guilds who participated and made our raid such a success.&nbsp; We were honored by your presence.&nbsp; Honorary Life Takers were:</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4">Snowloft,&nbsp; Goldenfox,&nbsp; Beastygirl,&nbsp; Shotzz&nbsp; &amp;&nbsp; Bilorre from Legerdemain.</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4">Zeikfreid</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4">Lilclover (who has become a regular raid member and we could not be happier!)</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">Gratz to Kelee,&nbsp;Kornin&nbsp;&amp; Tine on receiving epic pieces on our Chardok raid of Dec. 12th!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4">On Thursday, Dec. 9th, we kicked the stuffings out of Ixiblat Fer in Burning Woods for Kelee's cleric epic.&nbsp; We beat Ixi like a circus monkey.</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffa500" size="4">Special thanks to Gaudiamus (Tine's Pally alt) for tanking on the Ixiblat raid.&nbsp; Other honored guests were Walkerrx and Rosemunki.&nbsp; We really appreciate you guys!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#deb887" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffffff" size="4">Gratz to Kelee on defeating Lord Gimblox and the Plasmatic Priest for pieces of her cleric epic.&nbsp;&nbsp;She also got another Pearlescent Fragment from Skyfire, only 2 more to go!&nbsp; Add Ixiblat Fer to Kelee's list of accomplishments!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#deb887" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4">Put your hands together for Avengous, who led a barbraid group against Grummus on Wed, Dec. 8th and came away with a victory!&nbsp; Grummus went down like a lead zeppelin!&nbsp; Nice work Ave!</font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#deb887" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" size="4"><font color="#ffffff">Gratz to Lysandra on defeating&nbsp;</font><a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?id=4470"><font face="Times New Roman" color="#ffffff">Faydedar</font></a><font color="#ffffff"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3">&nbsp;</font> in Timorous Deep and gaining another piece of her epic!</font></font></p> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#ffff00" size="4"></font>&nbsp;</p> <p align="left"> <p align="left"><font face="Verdana" color="#7fffd4" size="4"></font></p><font face="Verdana" color="#deb887" size="4"></font> <p></p>
							
